#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:5
#: 51ecd78ba7fc4355b32634198351c310
msgid "Motor Thrust Scaling"
msgstr "电机推力缩放"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:7
#: b198265b044b4c87a3074eeba13a79c1
msgid ""
"QuadPlane includes *motor thrust scaling* which compensates for the non-"
"linear thrust output of most ESCs and motors."
msgstr "QuadPlane 包含*电机推力缩放*功能，用于补偿大多数 ESC 和电机的非线性推力输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:12
#: df416c49d8454d92a3b15bddeeb4cc15
msgid ""
"The default curve should work for nearly all ESC/motor combinations. "
"Normally the parameters should not be adjusted unless the vehicle’s actual "
"thrust curve has been measured."
msgstr "默认曲线应适用于几乎所有 ESC/电机组合。通常情况下，除非已测量了飞行器的实际推力曲线，否则不应调整这些参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:18
#: 8b3f72e9dcc74a57882a094d165fb1ef
msgid "Thrust Curves"
msgstr "推力曲线"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:20
#: 4f6f15431f89400c90db62caf46960fe
msgid "The curve is controlled by two parameters:"
msgstr "该曲线由两个参数控制："

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:22
#: ad433e923c7240c7baf5cf12fa0a65b3
msgid ""
":ref:`Q_M_THST_EXPO<Q_M_THST_EXPO>` controls the shape of the thrust curve "
"with \"0\" meaning a completely linear curve and \"1.0\" being very curved "
"(see pictures below).  The default is \"0.65\" (the image below incorrectly "
"states the default is 0.5)."
msgstr ""
":ref:`Q_M_THST_EXPO<Q_M_THST_EXPO>` "
"控制推力曲线的形状，「0」表示完全线性曲线，「1.0」表示非常弯曲（见下图）。默认值为「0.65」（下图错误地显示默认值为 0.5）。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:30
#: b2e8eac03573492f80a8beda1309c441
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MAX<MOT_SPIN_MAX>` controls the point at which the thrust "
"flattens out near its maximum.  This is fixed at 0.95, meaning 95% of full "
"throttle."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_SPIN_MAX<MOT_SPIN_MAX>` 控制推力在最大值附近趋于平坦的点。固定为 0.95，即满油门的 95%。"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:35
#: e28738d6c14f4c2b84c72f1de4595b59
msgid "Thrust Stands"
msgstr "推力台架"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:37
#: ceebd34c17a540d88f61ed89fc5e0e6c
msgid ""
"The thrust stands listed below can be used to measure the PWM signal vs "
"thrust output for a vehicle's specific motor, esc and battery"
msgstr "以下推力台架可用于测量特定电机、ESC 和电池组合的 PWM 信号与推力输出"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:39
#: 6f10b58650714b229e03421cbc6022da
msgid ""
"`RCbenchmark.com thrust stands "
"<https://www.rcbenchmark.com/pages/series-1580-thrust-stand-dynamometer>`__"
msgstr ""
"`RCbenchmark.com 推力台架 <https://www.rcbenchmark.com/pages/series-1580-thrust-"
"stand-dynamometer>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:40
#: ee8ef98f6ddc4b04a539a912dcda72db
msgid ""
"`Turnigy thrust stand <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-thrust-stand-and-"
"power-analyser-v3.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Turnigy 推力台架 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-thrust-stand-and-power-"
"analyser-v3.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:43
#: 19ba693ae1534e58a21fc57d97b228ab
msgid "Parameter Calculation"
msgstr "参数计算"

#: ../../source/docs/motor-thrust-scaling.rst:45
#: d7bfbac048a04b32a7b744b0b13f9d20
msgid ""
"A copy of `this spreadsheet "
"<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_75aZqiT_K1CdduhUe4-DjRgx3Alun4p8V2pt6vM5P8/edit#gid=0>`__"
" can be used to calculate the appropriate values from the thrust stand data "
"above."
msgstr ""
"可使用 `此电子表格 "
"<https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1_75aZqiT_K1CdduhUe4-DjRgx3Alun4p8V2pt6vM5P8/edit#gid=0>`__"
" 的副本，根据上述推力台数据计算合适的参数值。"
